# Copy to .env.local for local development. Set the same names in Vercel.

# Supabase → Project Settings → API. Both are public by design (RLS protects data).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_xxx

# Server-only AI keys for photo show detection (#14) and email/photo import.
# With neither set the log form still works, just without suggestions. Never
# prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_. Groq is tried first; Claude (with web search) is
# the fallback when Groq fails or can't name the show. See src/lib/ai/index.ts.
# GROQ_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional extra providers, used only when named in AI_MODELS below.
# Gemini takes photos and can search Google; Cerebras is text only.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# CEREBRAS_API_KEY=

# Optional: which models to try, in order ("provider" or "provider:model").
# Providers: groq, anthropic, gemini, cerebras.
# AI_MODELS applies to every task; AI_MODELS_IDENTIFY overrides it for photos.
# AI_MODELS=groq,anthropic
# AI_MODELS_IDENTIFY=groq:meta-llama/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct,anthropic:claude-opus-5-5
